{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"practice-专项-source-92a82eb39452","kind":"practice","title":"【未上传】专题十　推测词义（专题资料包）（可作答题）","year":"专项","region":"资料","variant":"可作答资料","instructions":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"专题十　推测词义"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"— 专题检测—"}]}],"sections":[{"id":"section-legacy","title":"旧卷综合题型","instructions":[],"layout":"flow","groups":[{"id":"group-legacy","instructions":[],"stimulusBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Passage 1"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Both fresh and processed foods make up vital parts of the food supply. Processed food contributes to both food security (quantity) and nutrition safety (quality). Nutrition and other professional scientists recognize that fresh, local foods cannot meet all nutritional requirements. Food processing is necessary."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Although nutritional security and food security both depend on food processing, in recent years there has been great public controversy over the nutritional contribution that they make to our diets."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"If enrichment were not present, large percentages of the population would have had inadequate vitamins and trace elements(微量元素)in their diets. Thus, processed foods are nutritionally important to our diets. How, then, do we increase the contribution of processed food to nutritional security and food security?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Rather than limiting processed foods in the diet, it may be more productive to encourage the best available food options, namely, those that provide fewer elements to limit and more nutrients to encourage for the calories consumed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One disadvantage of commercial food processing techniques is that they are poorly understood.Commercial food processing involves techniques that are difficult for the general public to grasp and that are out of their control, thus introducing a lack of transparency(透明)and leading to suspicion and concerns about safety in some individuals."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"In addition, concerns about the nutritional content and other aspects of the production of processed food have caused criticisms of processed foods as “over-processed” and not compatible(兼容的)with good nutrition. However, the type and extent of processing do not necessarily relate to nutritional content of the product."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.What causes disagreement over food processing?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"A.Food quality.　　　B.Food options."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"C.Food quantity.　　　D.Food supplies. "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.What does the underlined word “suspicion” in paragraph 5 probably mean?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"A.Excitement.　　　B.Satisfaction."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"C.Depression.　　　D.Doubt."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.What does the writer think of food processing?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"A.It has a positive influence on people’s diets."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"B.It should be increased significantly. "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"C.It would require further investigation."}]}],"sharedOptions":[],"questions":[{"id":"q-1","displayNumber":1,"sourceQuestionNumber":1,"type":"single_choice","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"What causes disagreement over food processing?"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[{"id":"A","label":"A","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Food quality."}]}]},{"id":"B","label":"B","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Food options."}]}]},{"id":"C","label":"C","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Food quantity."}]}]},{"id":"D","label":"D","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Food supplies."}]}]}],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"auto","kind":"choice","acceptedAnswers":["C"],"normalization":{"unicodeNfkc":true,"trim":true,"collapseSpaces":true,"caseSensitive":false}},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"92a82eb39452f1383fc340a87d6350bdd49239ea2b13b7bbd96b74d57e66b350","relativePath":"题型/【未上传】专题十　推测词义（专题资料包）.docx","sha256":"92a82eb39452f1383fc340a87d6350bdd49239ea2b13b7bbd96b74d57e66b350","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"7d9d79dac68c4ddb33b8ea35287ff3d7e4eda3a047e66265105beed5b5576ab0","answerVariantFingerprint":"ecc0461b2ca0fb6be0cd731e1b2715a677a60ff6923a467145cbf99119553d25"}},{"id":"q-2","displayNumber":2,"sourceQuestionNumber":2,"type":"single_choice","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"What does the underlined word “suspicion” in paragraph 5 probably mean?"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[{"id":"A","label":"A","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Excitement."}]}]},{"id":"B","label":"B","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Satisfaction."}]}]},{"id":"C","label":"C","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Depression."}]}]},{"id":"D","label":"D","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Doubt."}]}]}],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"auto","kind":"choice","acceptedAnswers":["A"],"normalization":{"unicodeNfkc":true,"trim":true,"collapseSpaces":true,"caseSensitive":false}},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"92a82eb39452f1383fc340a87d6350bdd49239ea2b13b7bbd96b74d57e66b350","relativeP